# Get started

To get started with Giolt, first install the Giolt SDK:

```
$ gleam add --dev giolt_sdk
```

The Giolt SDK includes the CLI to build, develop and deploy your app with Giolt.
To build your app, run:

```
$ gleam run -m giolt build
```

This will create a `./build/prod/javascript` folder with the entrypoint to your app.

Giolt also provides a development live server for your app:

```
$ gleam run -m giolt dev
```

Note that if you don't want to write all of that everytime you start coding, you can use
the included `gleam dev` command by creating a `app_dev.gleam` file:

```gleam
// app_dev.gleam
import giolt_sdk/dev.{dev}

pub fn main() {
  dev()
}
```

